  "narrative": {
    "text": "**Business & market dynamics:** Subprime auto financing demand is running strong, fueling record quarterly contract purchases and the highest portfolio balance in company history. An AI-driven underwriting approach supports disciplined growth, keeping credit quality sound—evidenced by negligible fair value adjustments and an attractive portfolio yield. The operating backdrop remains favorable, with rising interest income and healthy origination momentum despite broader macro uncertainties.\n\n**Management strategy and execution:** Leadership is scaling operations through a consistent AI-first lending strategy, lifting originations while preserving asset quality. The steady string of earnings improvements, a record balance sheet, and minimal credit marks reflect disciplined underwriting and servicing. A proactive investor presentation underscores management’s focus on transparency and technology, and the experienced team’s execution is reinforcing market confidence in the company’s ability to sustain profitable growth.",
